      "content": "Oh, no, I know. It's not my first move and using moving companies. So yeah, okay. And the other thing just to, to verify what I read on your estimate was that offer does include taxes and everything. So no surprise charges other than the minutes and stuff and then, and they do have the supplies like you said for wrapping or whatever.",
